cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AstroLens: A unified library of vision models for astronomy"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Md. Khairul"
    family-names: Islam
    affiliation: University of Virginia
repository-code: "https://github.com/khairulislam/AstroLens"
url: "https://github.com/khairulislam/AstroLens"
abstract: >-
  AstroLens collects vision architectures and foundation models
  for astronomy under a single registry and a common PyTorch
  interface, covering galaxy morphology classification, strong
  gravitational lensing, and multimodal representation learning.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - astrophysics
  - deep-learning
  - computer-vision
  - pytorch
  - foundation-models
  - galaxy-morphology
  - gravitational-lensing
